    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8721f5c04519368c",
      "translationZh": "在与硬件和引擎问题斗争了几天之后，我终于在我的多GPU rig上让 Qwen 3.8 Next 正常运行。我想分享设置过程、基准测试和热结果，供任何尝试类似事情的人参考。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a3fa54d09e9b4a7",
      "translationZh": "看到 Reddit 上关于多GPU设置变成绝对空间加热器并起火的持续 meme，我决定进行一些严格的热测试来亲自验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c4106b07774883df",
      "translationZh": "故障排除奥德赛",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ecc5d27da3010af",
      "translationZh": "PCIe 链路速度问题：安装后不久，其中一张卡降到了 PCIe Gen 1 x16。我在两天内花了约 8 小时进行诊断和修复。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fefa1d83fac9a009",
      "translationZh": "寻找合适的引擎：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3336027329fd2448",
      "translationZh": "我最初使用了 sglang-v100 ，但一直遇到持续的 OOM 崩溃。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d3240037992f0d0",
      "translationZh": "Reddit 上有人之前建议使用 pxa 引擎，但那也报错了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f5b8b8ddb7245e9",
      "translationZh": "最终我尝试了 1cat-vllm ，花了一些时间调整它，终于实现了稳定运行！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32dd570382d0d75c",
      "translationZh": "运行时使用 TP2 PP3 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "258d095c8b7c37da",
      "translationZh": "目前，推测解码仅限于 speculative=1 。将其设置为 2 会因内存限制导致 OOM（以后可能会研究优化，但目前它有效）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "feabcb777c511509",
      "translationZh": "上下文 & 内存统计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "896d376f7bb7acae",
      "translationZh": "性能基准测试",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f97df4ed61093d10",
      "translationZh": "1. 提示处理（Prefill）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11a3f76b93473f9c",
      "translationZh": "输入长度（Token） 速度（tok/s）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "75b2c7cbc9facb64",
      "translationZh": "2. 文本生成（MTP 对比）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4011ec38491d8c49",
      "translationZh": "输出长度（Token） 基础速度（无 MTP，tok/s） 优化速度（启用 MTP，tok/s）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1605b545207f385",
      "translationZh": "MTP 在各方面几乎将生成吞吐量提高了一倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9f7e3f31a62d658",
      "translationZh": "人们经常把多 GPU 机架说成会变成空间加热器或喷气式发动机的梗，所以我进行了彻底的热应力测试：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6bb26e98ce39854a",
      "translationZh": "压力测试：连续运行 gpu-burn 20 分钟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "951aa2d03ec8082e",
      "translationZh": "热平衡：温度峰值达到 65°C，随后稳定在约 64°C。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "547487619f814b7d",
      "translationZh": "风扇曲线：根据我的风扇控制脚本，在 64°C 时风扇仅以约 76% 的转速运行。即使不满速，显卡温度也远低于 65°C。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35e44b2927563ac6",
      "translationZh": "对系统如此稳定、凉爽且安静我很满意。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47f42a5593bdb06a",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Odd_Caterpillar_2994 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
